Scope
-----
- The Apache License 2.0 covers the code in this repository (src/, scripts/,
  notebooks/, configs/, patches/) and its documentation.

- patches/ contains changes to Mask DINO
  (https://github.com/IDEA-Research/MaskDINO, Copyright 2022 - present, IDEA,
  Apache License 2.0). The patch file shows every change to the original files;
  patches/point_mask.py is a new file added to Mask DINO.

- release/weights/ (trained model weights) and the prediction files
  release/oof_swa2_a0.75.json and release/submission_final.csv are not covered
  by the Apache License. The weights were initialised from the Mask DINO COCO
  checkpoint and trained on the MAGFiLO data provided for the Solar Filament
  Segmentation Challenge 2026; the prediction files contain masks predicted on
  MAGFiLO training and test images. They are provided to reproduce and verify
  the competition results; any other use is subject to the terms of the MAGFiLO
  dataset and of the competition.

- Detectron2 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/detectron2) and Mask DINO are
  not included in this repository and keep their own licenses (Apache License
  2.0).
